graph LR
    Lead[Lead] --> Qual[Qualification]
    Qual --> Prop[Proposal]
    Prop --> SE[Scheduled Event]
    SE --> Neg[Negotiation]
    Neg --> Trans[Transaction]
    Trans --> Comp[Completion]

    %% Invalidation Loop
    Neg -.->|Evidence Invalidated| Susp[Suspended / Non-Compliant]
    Trans -.->|Evidence Invalidated| Susp
    Susp -->|New Event Resolution| Neg

    subgraph Supported Verticals Without Runtime Modifications
        HC[Healthcare]
        Rec[Recruitment]
        RE[Real Estate]
        Ins[Insurance]
        Edu[Education]
    end

    classDef rules fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    Rules[Rules:<br/>- Never rewind history.<br/>- Only move forward through new events.]:::rules
